      "content": "finding a space outside of it... i dont know if that's even possible. it feels more like there's just no space left. like the light is just fading and there's no sense in fighting the dark when the night is so much more peaceful. there's a certain kind of dignity in just letting go when your time has passed, isnt there? instead of struggling against something that's already over.",
